node_modules/
dist/
# The built drive CLI binary. `go build ./...` in the repo root writes ./drive;
# it is a build artifact, never committed. The pattern is anchored to the repo
# root: a bare `drive` also ignored the cmd/drive source directory, so a new
# file there was added to the working tree and silently left out of the commit.
/drive
.env
.env.*
.dev.vars
.wrangler/
.cloudflare/
